title: A Challenge Inside the Caucus
subtitle: One of our own factions is choosing a new voice.
tags: event
view-if: faction_contest_ready
priority: 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_senate.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.prepareContest(Q, 'faction'); Q.faction_leader_timer = 7 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 4); !}

= A Challenge Among the [+ contest_group_name +]

[+ contest_ch +] is challenging [+ contest_inc +] to speak for the Caucus's [+ contest_group_name +]. The faction's senators will decide, but the leadership's view carries weight.

**[+ contest_inc +]** ([+ contest_inc_tag +]). [+ contest_inc_blurb +] Wants [+ contest_inc_demand +].

**[+ contest_ch +]** ([+ contest_ch_tag +]). [+ contest_ch_blurb +] Wants [+ contest_ch_demand +].

[+ contest_odds +] A firmer leader makes the faction quicker to anger and quicker to break away. A pragmatist makes it more patient.

- @let_decide: Let the faction decide for itself.
- @adv_inc: Have [+ contest_adv_name +] rally the backbenches for [+ contest_inc +].
- @adv_ch: Have [+ contest_adv_name +] rally the backbenches for [+ contest_ch +].
- @back_inc: Use the leadership's weight for [+ contest_inc +].
- @back_ch: Use the leadership's weight for [+ contest_ch +].

@let_decide
subtitle: The faction appreciates being left to choose.
on-arrival: {! SW.resolveContest(Q, ''); !}
go-to: faction_contest_result

@adv_inc
view-if: contest_adv
subtitle: Free, but our advisors can't act for a while. Backing the loser will anger the faction.
on-arrival: {! Q.advisor_action_timer = Math.max(Q.advisor_action_timer, 2); SW.resolveContest(Q, 'inc'); !}
go-to: faction_contest_result

@adv_ch
view-if: contest_adv
subtitle: Free, but our advisors can't act for a while. Backing the loser will anger the faction.
on-arrival: {! Q.advisor_action_timer = Math.max(Q.advisor_action_timer, 2); SW.resolveContest(Q, 'ch'); !}
go-to: faction_contest_result

@back_inc
view-if: not contest_adv
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 political capital.
subtitle: Costs 1 political capital. Backing the loser will anger the faction.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; SW.resolveContest(Q, 'inc'); !}
go-to: faction_contest_result

@back_ch
view-if: not contest_adv
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 1 political capital.
subtitle: Costs 1 political capital. Backing the loser will anger the faction.
on-arrival: {! Q.capital -= 1; SW.resolveContest(Q, 'ch'); !}
go-to: faction_contest_result

@faction_contest_result

[? if contest_changed : **[+ contest_winner +]** now speaks for the [+ contest_group_name +]. ?][? if not contest_changed : **[+ contest_winner +]** sees off the challenge. ?] [? if contest_backed_won : The faction knows the leadership stood with the winner. ?][? if contest_backed_lost : The faction knows the leadership backed the loser, and it is not happy. ?]

[+ contest_effect +]
